7. WAP to check whether a given number is odd or not. If it is odd, cube the number.
8. WAP to check whether a given character is an alphabet (letter) or not. If it is an alphabet, print “Hello World.”
9. WAP to check whether a given character is uppercase or not. If it is uppercase, print that character.
